# This is a file of tests for the GMOS sequencer in a suitable format to be read
# by the tcsTests.tk procedure.
# 
# This particular test file is aimed at checking the input ranges to 
# the GMOS 'mskPos' CAD command.
#
#
# Comments are introduced by a # in the first column
# Blank lines can be left if required.
# The currently allowed keywords are (case is immaterial)
#
#  Test   <testId>
#  Command <commandName>
#  Field   <CAD field> <value>
#  Response Accept | Reject
#  Timeout <msecs>
#  OnError Continue | Abort
#  Log     <recordName>
#  Directive Start | Preset

# This first part before the first Test keyword can be used to setup 
# global values for Response, TimeOut and OnError. These global values
# can be over ridden within specific tests

Response Reject
TimeOut  30000
OnError  Continue

Help
Help These tests checks the trapping of invalid input to the
Help mskPos command.
Help
Help The first tests check for null input. If the commands in question have
Help been run at any time after booting and prior to running these tests then
Help there will already be input on the CAD fields and so these null tests
Help will fail. To validate the trapping of null input you will have to
Help reboot the GMOS sequencer and start these tests again.
Help
Help Press continue when ready
Help

# Tests start here. Each test must start with the Test keyword, end with
# a Directive keyword and have at least one Command keyword. Any Field
# keywords are assumed to apply to the last command

Test UT02010
Summary Check rejection of null input
Help Check rejection of null input

 Command mskPos 
 Field  DIR MARK   
 Response  Reject 
 Directive Start

Test UT02020
Summary Check rejection of null input to Mask location field 
Help Check rejection of null input to Mask location field 

 Command mskPos 
 Field  A  40000000
 Response  Reject 
 Directive Start

Test UT02030
Summary Check rejection of invalid input to MaskId field
Help Check rejection of invalid input to MaskId field

 Command mskPos 
 Field  A  XXXXX 
 Field  B  IN-BEAM
 Response  Reject 
 Directive Start

Test UT02040
Summary Check rejection of invalid input to Mask location field
Help Check rejection of invalid input to Mask location field

  Aftertest Pause

 Command mskPos 
  Field  A  40000000
  Field  B  xxxxx
  Response  Reject 
  Directive Start

Test UT02050
Summary Check acceptance of valid MaskId and IN-BEAM position
Help Check acceptance of valid MaskId and IN-BEAM position
  Aftertest Pause

 Command mskPos 
  Field  A  40000000
  Field  B  IN-BEAM
  Response  Accept
  Directive Start

Test UT02060
Summary Check acceptance of valid MaskId with OUT-OF-BEAM position
Help Check acceptance of valid MaskId with OUT-OF-BEAM position
  Aftertest Pause

 Command mskPos 
  Field  A  40000000
  Field  B  OUT-OF-BEAM
  Response  Accept 
  Directive Start
 
Test UT02070
Summary Check acceptance of invalid MaskId with OUT-OF-BEAM position
Help Check acceptance of invalid MaskId with OUT-OF-BEAM position
  Aftertest Pause

 Command mskPos 
  Field  A  XXXX
  Field  B  OUT-OF-BEAM
  Response  Accept 
  Directive Start
 
